  abilityDesc: 17 combo Fire attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    20 combo random Fire attack on all foes, Injury, Weakness, Sickness, Paralysis
    infliction, raises normal hit amount for 3 turns, probable 2 turns Atk, Def reduction
    infliction & normal attacks hits all foes for 3 turns
